# Copy to .qatoolignore in the repository root. One pattern per line.
# Lines starting with '#' are comments; paths are relative to the repo root.
#
# Pattern syntax:
#   name            matches any file or directory with that name at any depth
#   dir/            matches a directory and everything beneath it
#   *.log           glob (fnmatch) matched against the full relative path
#   docs/*.md       glob with a path component
#
# Secret-like files (.env*, *.pem, *.key, credentials.json, *.tfstate, ...) and
# generated files (lockfiles, *.min.js, dist/, build/, ...) are always excluded;
# .qatoolignore only adds repo-specific exclusions.

fixtures/
*.snap
legacy/generated/*
internal-notes.md
